    "sentiment": -0.5,
    "quote": "The current Inquiry proposal continues this trend by further reducing standards and safeguards of the former strong legal framework, with the objective of broadly restricting the right and further tightening conditions applicable to persons with asylum-related residence permits and their family members.",
